{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119673","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119673/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119673/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119673/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119673","id":4505600587,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDI4CSw","number":119673,"title":"Shader loading from cache can fail with 'ERROR: Condition \"br != variant_size\" is true. Returning: false' intermittently","user":{"login":"brycehutchings","id":5100250,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDAyNTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5100250?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings","html_url":"https://github.com/brycehutchings","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brycehutchings/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":865585000,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NjU1ODUwMDA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:xr","name":"topic:xr","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-05-22T21:07:38Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T15:36:21Z","closed_at":"2026-06-18T15:25:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.6.1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.mrlink5.mono (84b816778) - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9186) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900K (32 threads) - 127.7 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nMy product runs --export-release and checks stderr for any errors to flag. Intermittently I am seeing the following error:\n\n> ERROR: Condition \"br != variant_size\" is true. Returning: false\n   at: ShaderRD::_load_from_cache (servers\\rendering\\renderer_rd\\shader_rd.cpp:503)\n\nI believe the issue is on this line: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f08e003ff23a667c24c76c0193ba31a02b5dae99/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shader_rd.cpp#L648\n\n<img width=\"797\" height=\"408\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/126198db-a466-40ed-8648-ec0e9ed1f0df\" />\nIt is not consuming the bytes of disabled variant, so on the next iteration of the loop it is reading the next variant size out of the content of the previous skipped variant. Instead, the code should only `continue;` after reading the data (but avoid storing it), or skip over the bytes like so:\n\n```c++\nuint32_t variant_size = f->get_32();\nif (!variants_enabled[variant_id]) {\n    f->seek(f->get_position() + variant_size);\n    continue;\n}\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThese aren't the steps I use, but I think they will be simpler:\n1. Create empty project\n2. Go to XR/Shaders in Project Settings and toggle Enabled on.\n3. Run and close\n4. Go to XR/Shaders in Project Settings and toggle Enabled off\n5. Run again. See \"br !=variant_size\" in editor's Errors tab.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMake empty project with default empty scene (single node3d root node) and follow repro steps.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119673/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119673/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}